let __v_315 = Value::from("For a doe the other side is thin: by four or five an unneutered female rabbit has uterine cancer in the great majority of cases, so the risk of waiting is far larger than the risk of the anaesthetic. A buck is done for the spraying and the mounting, and the operation is routine in a rabbit that is healthy and eating.");
