let __v_1384 = Value::from("Bathe it with cool water or salt water, dry it and keep the {kind} from licking it, and get the vet to look today if it is deep, gaping, bleeding steadily or it will not put weight on it. Check between the toes and across the pad for glass or a grass seed, since those keep a small cut open. A nick that has stopped bleeding: bathe it twice a day, keep it dry and covered on walks, and ring the vet if it goes red, swollen or smelly.");
