let __v_1953 = Value::from("A cat that keeps being sick needs the vet rather than a wait-and-see: repeated vomiting in a cat is often a swallowed blockage (string, a hairband, a toy) or a poison, and cats go downhill fast. Offer small amounts of water, no food for a few hours, and ring the vet; go straight away if there is blood, if she is retching with nothing coming up, or if she is flat and hiding.");
