let __v_1954 = Value::from("One vomit or one loose poo in a dog that is otherwise bright is usually nothing: withhold food for a few hours, then offer small amounts of plain chicken and rice, and keep the water down. Ring the vet if it repeats, if there's blood, if he is flat and not drinking, or if it is a puppy, an old dog or going on for more than a day.");
