let __v_2048 = Value::from("Ring today rather than wait if the animal is struggling to breathe, straining to pee and passing nothing (a blocked cat can die in a day), has a hard swollen belly, is fitting, has eaten something poisonous, or cannot stand - say exactly what you see when you ring. For anything else the call is free: most practices triage on the phone and will tell you whether to come in, and a nurse appointment costs less than a consultation.");
frame.store("_WHEN_A_VET_IS_NEEDED", __v_2048.clone())?;
let __v_2049 = Value::from("A vet treats animals, not people: for a person, ring 111 or the GP surgery today - and 999 if they are struggling to breathe, confused, blue at the lips or have chest pain. Say how long it has been going on and what you have noticed, and the call costs nothing. If it is a child, a baby or someone frail or elderly, ring rather than wait to see how the day goes.");
