let __v_2076 = Value::from("A bed it can stretch out flat in, two bowls, a collar and a lead, a harness for walks where it pulls, poo bags and food of the brand it is already on, plus a coat if it has a thin coat like a greyhound. A rescue usually comes with its own lead and a bag of food, so ask the centre what it has been eating and keep to that for the first fortnight, and budget about £1,500 to £2,000 a year for a dog before any vet bill.");
